"char_end": 284,
"unit_id": "t0003.u01",
"sent_id": "t0003.s01"
},
{
"start": 40.858,
"end": 44.243,
"speaker_label": "In\u00eas Carvalho",
"text": "And it connects to what we're going to discuss today.",
"char_start": 285,
"char_end": 338,
"unit_id": "t0003.u01",
"sent_id": "t0003.s02"
},
{
"start": 44.243,
"end": 51.735,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "I want to point out something \u2013 Rafael Vasconcelos mentioned this same dynamic a few episodes ago.",
"char_start": 356,
"char_end": 454,
"unit_id": "t0004.u01",
"sent_id": "t0004.s01"
},
{
"start": 51.735,
"end": 53.937,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "Give me a concrete example.",
"char_start": 455,
"char_end": 482,
"unit_id": "t0004.u01",
"sent_id": "t0004.s02"
},
{
"start": 53.937,
"end": 58.016,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "Where do soil erosion and enduro racing intersect?",
"char_start": 483,
"char_end": 533,
"unit_id": "t0004.u01",
"sent_id": "t0004.s03"
},
{
"start": 58.016,
"end": 64.722,
"speaker_label": "In\u00eas Carvalho",
"text": "Honestly, speed comes from braking earlier and more smoothly, not from taking bigger risks.",
"char_start": 549,
"char_end": 640,
"unit_id": "t0005.u01",
"sent_id": "t0005.s01"
},
{
"start": 64.722,
"end": 67.891,
"speaker_label": "In\u00eas Carvalho",
"text": "We've seen this in teams that use RockShox.",
"char_start": 641,
"char_end": 684,
"unit_id": "t0005.u01",
"sent_id": "t0005.s02"
},
{
"start": 67.891,
"end": 72.976,
"speaker_label": "In\u00eas Carvalho",
"text": "I've observed this pattern repeating itself in three different teams.",
"char_start": 685,
"char_end": 754,
"unit_id": "t0005.u01",
"sent_id": "t0005.s03"
},
{
"start": 72.976,
"end": 75.221,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "I want to delve deeper into that.",
"char_start": 772,
"char_end": 805,
"unit_id": "t0006.u01",
"sent_id": "t0006.s01"
},
{
"start": 75.221,
"end": 78.622,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "Where do soil erosion and enduro racing intersect?",
"char_start": 806,
"char_end": 856,
"unit_id": "t0006.u01",
"sent_id": "t0006.s02"
},
{
"start": 78.622,
"end": 79.229,
"speaker_label": "In\u00eas Carvalho",
"text": "Certainly.",
"char_start": 872,
"char_end": 882,
"unit_id": "t0007.u01",
"sent_id": "t0007.s01"
},
{
"start": 79.229,
"end": 85.113,
"speaker_label": "In\u00eas Carvalho",
"text": "Tire pressure and the choice of tire casing often matter more than a minor suspension adjustment.",
"char_start": 883,
"char_end": 980,
"unit_id": "t0007.u01",
"sent_id": "t0007.s02"
},
{
"start": 85.113,
"end": 90.572,
"speaker_label": "In\u00eas Carvalho",
"text": "Understanding the setup is important because it tells you what compromises you are making.",
"char_start": 981,
"char_end": 1071,
"unit_id": "t0007.u01",
"sent_id": "t0007.s03"
},
{
"start": 90.572,
"end": 91.999,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "Let's start there.",
"char_start": 1089,
"char_end": 1107,
"unit_id": "t0008.u01",
"sent_id": "t0008.s01"
},
{
"start": 91.999,
"end": 95.961,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "Where do soil erosion and enduro racing intersect?",
"char_start": 1108,
"char_end": 1158,
"unit_id": "t0008.u01",
"sent_id": "t0008.s02"
},
{
"start": 95.961,
"end": 103.71,
"speaker_label": "In\u00eas Carvalho",
"text": "Honestly, risk management in racing isn't about avoiding crashes; it's about choosing which crashes are survivable.",
"char_start": 1174,
"char_end": 1289,
"unit_id": "t0009.u01",
"sent_id": "t0009.s01"
},
{
"start": 103.71,
"end": 106.54,
"speaker_label": "In\u00eas Carvalho",
"text": "We've seen this in teams that use Shimano.",
"char_start": 1290,
"char_end": 1332,
"unit_id": "t0009.u01",
"sent_id": "t0009.s02"
},
{
"start": 106.54,
"end": 112.066,
"speaker_label": "In\u00eas Carvalho",
"text": "If you ignore this, you'll end up rebuilding everything from scratch a year later.",
"char_start": 1333,
"char_end": 1415,
"unit_id": "t0009.u01",
"sent_id": "t0009.s03"
},
{
"start": 112.066,
"end": 114.445,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "Where does it stop working?",
"char_start": 1433,
"char_end": 1460,
"unit_id": "t0010.u01",
"sent_id": "t0010.s01"
},
{
"start": 114.445,
"end": 119.508,
"speaker_label": "In\u00eas Carvalho",
"text": "The Cascadia Alliance is one of the platforms where this is clearly evident.",
"char_start": 1476,
"char_end": 1552,
"unit_id": "t0011.u01",
"sent_id": "t0011.s01"
},
{
"start": 119.508,
"end": 124.238,
"speaker_label": "In\u00eas Carvalho",
"text": "And the second-order effect is the part that almost everyone overlooks.",
"char_start": 1553,
"char_end": 1624,
"unit_id": "t0011.u01",
"sent_id": "t0011.s02"
},
{
"start": 124.238,
"end": 127.139,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "What heuristic do you always go back to?",
"char_start": 1642,
"char_end": 1682,
"unit_id": "t0012.u01",
"sent_id": "t0012.s01"
},
{
"start": 127.139,
"end": 130.476,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "How does Spoke & Wrench fit into this picture?",
"char_start": 1683,
"char_end": 1729,
"unit_id": "t0012.u01",
"sent_id": "t0012.s02"
},
{
"start": 130.476,
"end": 131.741,
"speaker_label": "In\u00eas Carvalho",
"text": "That's how I see it.",
"char_start": 1745,
"char_end": 1765,
"unit_id": "t0013.u01",
"sent_id": "t0013.s01"
},
{
"start": 131.741,
"end": 139.839,
"speaker_label": "In\u00eas Carvalho",
"text": "The erosion patterns on the track sections can change the optimal racing line between practice sessions and the actual race day.",
"char_start": 1766,
"char_end": 1894,
"unit_id": "t0013.u01",
"sent_id": "t0013.s02"
},
{
"start": 139.839,
"end": 144.015,
"speaker_label": "In\u00eas Carvalho",
"text": "Once you understand that, the rest of the decisions become easier.",
"char_start": 1895,
"char_end": 1961,
"unit_id": "t0013.u01",
"sent_id": "t0013.s03"
},
{
"start": 173.901,
"end": 176.199,
